    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div><p class="lp-kicker">The CallTeam buying desk / 05</p><h1>9 best <span>Apollo alternatives<br>for cold calling.</span></h1><p class="lp-intro">Missing mobile numbers? Paying for contacts you cannot use? See what another provider adds, what it costs and what you would lose by leaving Apollo.</p><div class="lp-actions"><a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare prices &amp; limits ↓</a><a class="lp-text-link" href="#contact-test">Get the 25-contact test →</a></div><p class="aa-brands">UpLead · Lusha · Lead411 · Cognism · ZoomInfo · SalesIntel · RocketReach · FullEnrich · Clay</p></div>
      <aside class="lp-brief" aria-labelledby="aa-brief-title"><p class="lp-kicker">Three sensible outcomes</p><h2 id="aa-brief-title">Keep it.<br>Add data.<br>Or switch.</h2><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Keep Apollo.</strong><p>Your buyers are covered and the workflow works.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Add another source.</strong><p>Specific accounts need useful numbers you do not have.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Replace it.</strong><p>The tested gains justify the full cost of moving.</p></div></li></ol><a href="#keep-apollo">Work out what needs fixing →</a></aside>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-direct-answer"><strong>Our starting shortlist:</strong> compare UpLead, Lusha, Lead411 and RocketReach for contact buying. Assess Cognism and SalesIntel when verification is the priority, and ZoomInfo for a wider platform need. Test FullEnrich or Clay when you want to fill gaps or build an enrichment workflow around the tools you already have.</p>
    <p class="lp-method"><strong>Sources checked {{ guide.reviewed }}.</strong> Official sources are linked in the reviews.</p>
