  <section class="lp-section" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">01 / Make a useful shortlist</p><h2>Apollo competitors.<br>The price and the catch.</h2><p>Compare the phone-enabled offer and the work it covers. All dollar amounts below are <strong>USD</strong>. Annual equivalents require an annual commitment. Credits, exports and phone reveals are different units.</p></div>
    <div class="aa-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table aa-comparison" role="table"><caption>9 Apollo.io alternatives for cold calling, with Apollo as the reference</caption><thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Provider</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Consider it when</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Price and allowance</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">The catch</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr class="aa-baseline-row" role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#apollo-baseline">Apollo ↗</a><span class="aa-reference">Your reference</span></th><td role="cell" data-label="Consider it when">Data and outreach already work together for your team.</td><td role="cell" data-label="Price and allowance"><strong>USD 49/seat/month</strong><span>Basic, billed annually: USD 588/year. Published allowance: 30,000 credits/year.</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="The catch">Phone, export and waterfall costs depend on the operation and plan. A phone reveal can consume several credits.</td></tr>
      {% for p in guide.providers %}<tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader"><a href="#{{ p.id }}">{{ p.name }} ↗</a></th><td role="cell" data-label="Consider it when">{{ p.fit }}</td><td role="cell" data-label="Price and allowance"><strong>{{ p.price }}</strong><span>{{ p.priceNote }}.</span><span class="aa-credit">{{ p.credits }}.</span></td><td role="cell" data-label="The catch">{{ p.catch }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody></table></div>
    <p class="lp-small">Prices are starting references for the named offer, before tax and extras. Follow the official sources in each review. “Unconfirmed” identifies a price we could not verify. “Custom quote” means the provider needs to price your requirements.</p>
    <div class="aa-baseline" id="apollo-baseline"><h3>Start with the Apollo bill you already have.</h3><p>Apollo's published annual reference prices are USD 49/seat/month for Basic and USD 79 for Professional. Check your own plan, remaining credits and add-ons before comparing a replacement. Unused credits expire at the end of the billing cycle.</p><p>Its API documentation lists an eight-credit phone component for standard people enrichment, with different costs for waterfall configurations. Legacy plans and other workflows can differ. Run a small lookup and check the deduction in your account.</p><p class="lp-sources"><strong>Apollo sources:</strong> <a href="https://www.apollo.io/insights/how-many-apollo-credits-do-i-have-left-before-i-run-a-large-enrichment-batch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Published plans and allowances ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.apollo.io/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Current pricing and rollover terms ↗</a> · <a href="https://docs.apollo.io/docs/api-pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">API credit rules ↗</a></p></div>
    <div class="aa-mid-cta"><div><h3>Already have leads? Put them to work.</h3><p>Hire CallTeam to prepare the list, make the calls and handle follow-up. Bring the provider you already use.</p></div><a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="apollo-comparison">Book a free 30-minute call ↗</a></div>
    <p class="lp-small">Choosing your first database? Start with our broader <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-providers/">B2B lead generation database comparison</a>.</p>
  </div></section>

