    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">04 / Free comparison checklist</p><h2>Try the same 25 contacts.<br>See what you actually gain.</h2><p>Copy this into your notes, check the same contacts in both tools and record the results. Reuse it for your next trial or renewal.</p></div>
    <div class="aa-test-layout"><div><pre id="aa-test-text" tabindex="0" aria-label="25-contact comparison test">{{ guide.testText }}</pre><button class="lp-button" type="button" id="aa-copy-test" hidden>Copy the 25-contact test</button><p id="aa-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><noscript><p class="lp-small">Select and copy the text above. The checklist works without JavaScript.</p></noscript></div><aside><h3>Count what the second source adds.</h3><p><strong>Example:</strong> another provider returns 18 numbers. Twelve are already in your CRM. Six are new. Your next check is whether those six belong to suitable buyers and provide a useful calling route.</p><p>Keep wrong numbers separate from no answer. Preserve legitimate shared switchboards used by several contacts.</p><p>A small sample helps you spot problems and decide what needs a larger test. Keep any calls within your normal outreach schedule.</p><a class="lp-text-link" href="/resources/b2b-lead-providers/#test-plan">Need more detail? Use the full scorecard →</a></aside></div>
